Thank you all for being part of the Early AccessːpaperheartːːpraisesunːːMHRISE_happyː Happy ːhawbstickːThanksgivingːmeat_production_atsː to everyone!

Change list

 Added Custom Team feature, Users can select Team’s:

    Name using name presets;
    Logo;
    Colors (Head gear, armor, players’ numbers, etc.);
    Offense and Defence identities (this determines which player positions will have the highest ratings on your team);
    Arena Style (select from all default teams arenas);
    Arena name using name presets;
    Arena location name using name presets;
    Add manually arena Hazards in the Doom Field Editor;
    Select musical theme from the list of available tracks;
    Already created Custom Team can be edited in the Season mode;
    Users can randomize every Team’s option.

 Added 32 teams season (18 weeks regular season, 8 divisions, 4 per conference), but not every team is available to play (only previously released playable teams. More teams are coming soon);
 Added option in Season mode to choose schedule between "Generated Season" or "2124 Season" schedules;
 Added ability to play as a Custom Team in the Online game modes. Right now, users can select only 1 Custom Team (the latest team created/used in Season game mode);
 Roster Updates to reflect latest major trades and roster cuts;
 Assorted bug fixes.

Please continue to share your feedback about the MFL 2 and specifically the latest feature additionsːcool_seagullː

Looking forward to hearing from all of you and seeing you in the game.
